    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that the policy push is there, but I'm worried about the actual feasibility. If you look at the massive capital expenditure needed for grid upgrades and the supply chain issues with rare earth minerals, it feels like the math doesn't always add up. Are these just temporary growing pains, or are they fundamental risks that could derail the whole transition?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
